msgid ""
"It computes the phonon dispersion, the lattice thermal conductivity in "
"the relaxation-time approximation (on a coarse :math:`4\\times4\\times4` "
"mesh, which takes a few seconds), and the frequencies at :math:`\\Gamma`,"
" X, and L."
msgstr ""
"このスクリプトは、フォノン分散、緩和時間近似による格子熱伝導率 (数秒で終わる粗い :math:`4\\times4\\times4` "
"メッシュ)、および :math:`\\Gamma`、X、L 点の振動数を計算します。"

#: ../../source/anphon_python.rst:391
msgid "The frequencies printed in step 3 are:"
msgstr "ステップ 3 で表示される振動数は次のとおりです:"

#: ../../source/anphon_python.rst:399
